<%= render(Primer::Alpha::Banner.new(scheme: :default, icon: :info, "data-target": "actions-policy-form.warning", hidden: true)) do %>
  <span data-target="actions-policy-form.wildcardWarningText" hidden>
    Your list contains a <code>*</code> wildcard pattern, which will <strong>allow all <%= policy_text %></strong> except those that are explicitly blocked.
  </span>
  <span data-target="actions-policy-form.onlyBlockedWarningText" hidden>
    Your list contains <strong>only blocked patterns</strong>. By default, only allowed patterns specified in the list can be used. To allow all <%= policy_text %> except those that are explicitly blocked, add a <code>*</code> wildcard pattern.
  </span>
<% end %>

